  "ruleText": "Odb 205.01 Public Hearing. The board shall hold a public hearing when proposing to adopt, readopt, amend or repeal rules.\n\nSource. #8490-A, eff 11-22-05; ss by #12941, eff 12-15-19; ss by #12941, eff 12-15-19",
